{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "53fb83ad-838b-5cc8-a15a-dde527c684f2",
    "name": "Keyword Search API 🔎🔎🔎",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "- Endpoint: `GET /kws1/api.{json|csv}` - websites containing a keyword.\n- Example: `https://api.builtwith.com/kws1/api.json?KEY=YOUR_KEY&KEYWORD=perfume`\n- Optional: `LIMIT` (16-1000, default 100), `OFFSET` from the previous page's `NextOffset`.\n- Requires a subscription (see WhoAmI `credits.costs.keyword_search_api`).\n\nSample response (`https://api.builtwith.com/samples/keyword_search_api_v1.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"Keyword\": \"perfume\",\n  \"Domains\": [\"example-store.com\"],\n  \"NextOffset\": \"example-store.com\"\n}\n```\n\nUpdated 2026-11-10 from https://api.builtwith.com/llms-full.txt. Set KEY locally. Requests are examples; sending data requests may consume credits. Optional query parameters are disabled until selected."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Search Websites by Keyword",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.builtwith.com/kws1/api.json?KEY={{KEY}}&KEYWORD=perfume&LIMIT=100",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "builtwith",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "kws1",
            "api.json"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "KEY",
              "value": "{{KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "KEYWORD",
              "value": "perfume"
            },
            {
              "key": "LIMIT",
              "value": "100"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Next Keyword Page",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.builtwith.com/kws1/api.json?KEY={{KEY}}&KEYWORD=perfume&LIMIT=100&OFFSET={{keywordOffset}}",
          "protocol": "https",
          "host": [
            "api",
            "builtwith",
            "com"
          ],
          "path": [
            "kws1",
            "api.json"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "KEY",
              "value": "{{KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "KEYWORD",
              "value": "perfume"
            },
            {
              "key": "LIMIT",
              "value": "100"
            },
            {
              "key": "OFFSET",
              "value": "{{keywordOffset}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
